[[61,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and disconnect the electrical connector (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004670\">See F010 LEFT HEADLAMP</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004673\">See F011 RIGHT HEADLAMP</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003008.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[61,7,0,"<p>1. Remove the lights cluster (1a), removing the pins (1b) from their seating in the bodywork.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003009.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[61,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the lights cluster, centring the pins in their seats in the bodywork.</p><p>Connect the electrical connector for the lights cluster.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004670\">See F010 LEFT HEADLAMP</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004673\">See F011 RIGHT HEADLAMP</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten on the lights cluster with the fixing bolts.</p>"]]